      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512729600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 32928,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512734200000
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. To get started, could I have your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512736200000
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Peterson. Order number is VF98765.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 32928,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512743066666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. I'm pulling that up now... I see an order for a Men's Velocity jersey. Is that the item you're calling about?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512745866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, the jersey.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 32928,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512754466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. And could you tell me, what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512755733332
    },
    {
      "text": "It's the wrong size. It's way too tight.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 32928,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512762666665
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear the fit wasn't right. Let me just check the policy for you. I see the delivery was 44 days ago, which is unfortunately outside our 10-day return period for apparel.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512765533331
    },
    {
