      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 32928,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512777199997
    },
    {
      "text": "We have a couple of options. We can process a return for a full refund, or I can set up an exchange for a larger size right now. There would be no cost to you for the exchange.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 301,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512777899997
    },
    {
      "text": "An exchange will probably take weeks. Just give me the refund.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 32928,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1768512789833330
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, a refund it is. I have just initiated the return process in our system. I'm sending a prepaid shipping label to the email address on your account. You should receive it in the next few minutes.",
